+### Clamp Durations
+
+Use `clamp` to hold a duration between two bounds, each a duration string or a number of milliseconds. It returns the duration in milliseconds.
+
+```ts
+import { clamp } from 'ms';
+
+clamp('2h', '1m', '1h'); // 3600000
+clamp('30s', '1m', '1h'); // 60000
+clamp(90000, '1m', '1h'); // 90000
+```
+
 ### Enhanced Type Safety
 
 If you want strict type checking for the input value, you can use `parseStrict`.
